vāme lambakarāṃ *mahandratanayāṃ mandāramālyādharām ।* (l.3)
devairarcitapādukāṃ śaśimukhīṃ *senānīvāmesthitām ।* (l.4)
muktāhāravibhūṣitāṃ dvinayanāṃ devīṃ tribhaṅgīṃ bhaja ॥ (l.5)
oṃ hrīṃ devasenāyai namaḥ ।
dakṣiṇe - oṃ hrīṃ mahāvalyāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hrīṃ(l.6)
śyāāmāṃ paṅkajadhāriṇīṃ maṇilasat tāṭaṅkarṇojvalām ।
dakṣelambakarāṃ *karaṇḍamakuṭāṃ satkuñcikāntastanīm ।* (p.28b, l.1)
anyonyekṣaṇa samyutāṃ śaravaṇodbhūtasya *savye sthitām ।* (l.2)
kandotbhāsitamālīkāṃ śaśimukhīṃ vallīśvarīṃ bhāvayet । (l.3)
oṃ hrīṃ mahāvalyai namaḥ ।
pūrvādi oṃ jayantāya namaḥ । aṃ agniśikhāya namaḥ । (l.4) kaṃ kṛttikāputrāya namaḥ ।
bhaṃ bhūtapataye namaḥ । saṃ senāpataye namaḥ । (l.5) gaṃ guhyāya namaḥ । haṃ hemaśūlāya namaḥ ।
vaṃ viśālākṣāya namaḥ । iti sampūjya । (p.29a, l.1)
oṃ hāṃ daṇḍyāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ daṇḍimūrttaye namaḥ ।
caturbhujaṃ traṇetrañca śyāmavarṇaṃ jaṭādharam । (l.2)
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ raudrarūpakam ।
daṇḍimuṇḍi gadāvāme savye sūcikarantu vā । (l.3)
triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇe haste ḍamarūṃ vāmahastake ।
uddhṛtaṃ savyavāmāṅghri pādā*brodadha vāmake ।* (l.4)
gadāgre mukulākāraṃ pādāgre sarpaveṣṭanam । (l.5)
kuñcitaṃ vāmapādaṃ muṇmālāvilambanam ।
lambavastrottarīyantu sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam । (l.6)
daṇḍiñca savyapārśve tu muṇḍiñca vāmapārśvake ।
oṃ hāṃ daṇḍine namaḥ । (p.30a, l.1)
tadantare । oṃ jaṃ jayāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ jaṃ jayamūrttaye namaḥ । (l.2)
triṇetrañca śaṅkhacakrajaṭādharam ।
damṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ bhīṣaṇaṃ raudrarūpakam ।
aṅkuśaṃ *dakṣiṇahaste pāśaṃ vāmakarānvitam ।* (l.3)
jayaṃ dakṣiṇapārśvantu vijayaṃ vāmapārśvake । (l.4)
oṃ hāṃ jayāyai namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ muṇḍyāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ muṇḍimūrttaye namaḥ । (l.5)
caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca raktavarṇaṃ jaṭādharam ।
sarvābharaṇa samyuktaṃ *bhīṣaṇaṃ raudrarūpakam ।* (l.6)
muṇḍidaṇḍgadāsavyavāme sūcikarantu vā । (p.30b, l.1)
aṅkuśaṃ dakṣiṇe haste pāśaṃvāmakarānvitam ।
uddhṛtaṃ vāmapādāṅghrī pādāgre gadasarvake । (l.2)
gadāgre mukulākāraṃ pādāgre sarṣaveṣṭanam ।
kuñcitaṃ dakṣapādaṃ tu *muṇḍamālāvilambanam ।* (l.3)
lambavastrottarīyaṃ tu sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam । (l.4)
muṇḍiñca vāmapārśvantu daṇḍisavyapārśvake ।
oṃ hāṃ muṇḍine namaḥ । (l.5)
oṃ viṃ vijayāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ viṃ vijayāmūrttaye namaḥ ।
caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca *śyāmavarṇaṃ jaṭādharam ।* (l.6)
daṃṣṭrākarālavaktrañca bhīṣaṇaṃ raudrarūpakam ।
pāśaṃ vā *dakṣiṇe haste aṅkuśaṃ vāmahastake ।* (p.31a, l.1)
vijayaṃ vāmapārśvantu jayaṃ dakṣiṇapārśvak । (l.2)
oṃ viṃ vijayāya namaḥ । sampūjya । (l.3)
sabhāpatidhyānam ।
ḍamaruṃ sṛṣṭirūpantu samhāraṃ cāgnirūpakam ।
stitirūpaṃ *bhujaṅgāsya tirobhāvantu kuñcitam ।* (l.4)
abhayaṃ anugrahañcaiva ityete pañcakṛtyakam । (l.5)
snānāntaragataṃ sṛṣṭistitikautukabandhanam ।
saṃhāramagaruṃ caiva tiraḥ *karpūralepanam ।* (l.6)
anugrahantu yatpaścāt prabhāte nṛttadarśanam । (p.31b, l.1) (side heading)
(mūṣikam, kailāsanandi)
mūṣikadhyānam ।
jihvādantaṃ ca yāmyañca mukhaṃ ca naiṛtiṃ tathā ।
netraṃ caiva divārātrau *karṇadvaṃ vāyudevatām ।* (l.2)
gātrañca bhuvanāṇḍaṃ syāt romaṃ vidyādharaiḥ muniḥ । (l.3)
puśchaṃpaṇi anantañca caturvedaṃ catuṣpadam ।
jīvasya brahmaviṣṇuśca *iti mūṣikameva cā ।* (l.4)
mūṣikāya namaḥ ।
nandikeśvaradhyānam ।
śrutipadmanalaśriṅgaṃ *bhāskaraṃ indunetravithi ।* (l.5)
śiravadanarudraṃ aśvanīkarṇarūpam ।
navamaṇi *kanakamālyāṃ nūpuraṃ divyaratnam ।* (p.32a, l.1)
sphaṭikadhavalagātraṃ dakṣarājaṃ namāmi । (l.2)
sihmadhyānam-
mukhaṃ ca vīrabhadraṃ syāt netraṃ caivāgnimeva ca ।
dantañca *aṣṭaśailañca jihvāyāṃ kālameva ca ।* (l.3)
romaṃ dehaṛṣīṃ caiva yamaṃ vakuryu *catuṣpadam ।* (l.4)
jihvaṃ prāṇaṃ ca lakṣmīṃ ca pucchaṃ sveti tathaivaca । (l.5)
iti sihmasamākhyātaṃ buddhimān deśikottamaḥ ।
sihmāya namaḥ । (p.32b, l.1) (side heading) (mayūram)
mayūradhyānam-
śikhāyāṃ niṣkalaṃ caivā śiraḥ brāhmāṇḍameva ca ।
dantanāsī ca *jihvāca brahmaviṣṇuśca indrayoḥ ।* (l.2)
netradvau sūryacandraśca vāyuragniśca karṇayoḥ । (l.3)
pakṣadvabhuvanaṃ caiva vedaśāstraṃ gātrayoḥ ।
pādadvau *bhakti munibhiḥnakṣatraṃ romameva ca ।* (l.4)
śyāmavarṇamahātmañca *mayūradhyānameva ca ।* (l.5)
oṃ sāṃ mayūrāya namaḥ । (p.33a, l.1) (side heading)
(vighneśvaraṃ, ṣaṇmukhaṃ)
gajānanaṃ triṇyanaṃ kuṅkumābhaṃ caturbhujam ।
savye dantañca pāśaṃ ca *vāmeśāṅkuśalaḍḍukam ।* (l.2)
abhayavaradahastaṃ vajraśaktiṃ praśastam ।
samatanu *samapādavidrumābhaṃ triṇetram ।* (l.3)
sakalavayasuśobhaṃ karṇatāṭaṅkaraṇḍam । (l.4)
sakalabhuvananāthaṃ skandarūpaṃ namāmi ।

ṣaḍvaktraṃ *śikhivāhanaṃ triṇayanaṃ pītāmbarālaṅkṛtām ।* (l.5)
śaṅkhaṃ cakra masiṃ ca śaktivaradaṃ *dorbhirdadhānaṃ sadā ।* (p.33b, l.1) (side heading) (umāmaheśvaram, śokkapāṇai)
dhyāyedīpsita siddhidaṃ śivasutaṃ skandaṃ surādhikam । (l.2)
umāmaheśvaradhyānam ।
ekamukha vedakara vidrumanibhām ।
kṛṣṇamṛgaṭaṅkakaṭābhaya *catuṣkam ।* (l.3)
lambapādavāmaguṇipādayutamīśam ।
candrayutamaulīdhara *śaktisutayuktam ।* (l.4)
oṃ hāṃ umāmaheśvarāya namaḥ ।
śokkapāṇai dhyānam । (l.5)
ekapādaṃ daśāṣṭahastaṃ daśāṣṭaśūlaṃ śirapañcatripañcanetram ।
unmīlavaktraṃ *hutavahni śaśāṅkanetraṃ* (p.34a, l.1) (side heading)
(astrarājam)
uddīptakeśaṃ matidiptahutāśanaliṅgam । (l.2)
tāladaṇḍantu bimbasyāt tatkāṣṭaṃ hastameva ca ।
bandhayet sūtranāḍi(ḍī)ca tālapa...ntu carmaṇi ॥ (l.3)
astrarāja dhyānam ।
tatvādhvā-bhuvanādhvā-varṇādhvā-padādhvā-mantrādhvā-(l.4)kalādhvā ।
triśūlāstrāsanāya namaḥ-
madhyāhnārkasamaprabhaṃ śaśidharaṃ bhīmāya hāsodvalam । (l.5)
tryakṣaṃ punnāgabhūṣaṇaṃ mṛgadharaṃ piṅgojvalam ।
mūrdhajaṃ hastābjaiḥ triśikhaṃ *samudgaramahāghaṇṭākapāladharam ।* (l.6)
dṛṣṭvātyugrabhayaṃ karaṃ paśupateḥ divyāstrarūpaṃ bhaje । (p.34b, l.1) (side heading)
(dhvajadaṇḍaṃ, vighneśvaram)
oṃ hāṃ triśūlāsanāya namaḥ । dhvajastambhadhyānam -
ekañcapādaṃ dvibhujaṃ dvinetram । (l.2)
romāvalīrājitadarbharajjum ।
śvetāṅgarūpaṃ śukanāsikañca ।
ārūḍhapadmāsanadaṇḍarūpam ॥ (l.3)
daṇḍesadāśivamabhyarcya ।
vighneśvaradhyānam-
ekāsyaṃ *trividhalocanaṃ gajamukhaṃ raktaṃ caturhastakam ।* (l.4)
vāme laḍḍukavāmānyakarayo *dantāṅkuśāṃbibhṛtām ।* (l.5)
vāmenidritapādamanyacaraṇāṃ hyudhṛtya vinyasatakam ।
hṛsvantundila*śūrpakarṇamaniśaṃ vighneśvaraṃ bhāvayet ।* (l.6)
(p.35a, l.1) (side heading)
(mayil yānai, brahmā)
mayūradhyānam -
citrasihmāsanāsīnaṃ bhujaṃ godhṛtavaktrakam ।
mahābalaṃ mahākāyaṃ mayūraṃ *praṇamyāham ।* (l.2)
gajendradhyānam-
he(hai)rāvatakulojātaṃ śvetarūpaṃ mahābalam । (l.3)
catuśriṅgasamāyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ।
brahmā -(l.4)
caturmukhaṃ caturbāhuṃ caturmakuṭasamyutam ।
mukhe mukhe dvinetraṃ ca *muñjidarbhairalaṅkṛtam ।* (l.5)
dakṣiṇe akṣamālāñca vāmahaste tu gaṇḍikā ।
dakṣiṇe'*bhayahastaṃ tu vāmahastantu ūrake ।* (p.35b, l.1) (side heading)
(dvārapālamuṇḍi, daṇḍi)
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ brahmarūpamitismṛtam ।
muṇḍi - (l.2)
muṇḍinaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇantu dvibhujañca dvinetrakam ।
daṇḍāyudhasamāyuktaṃ nāgābharaṇabhūṣitam । (l.3)
vismitaṃ hastasasaṃyuktaṃ muṇḍināṃ ca svarūpakam । (l.4)
daṇḍidhyānam-
raktavarṇaṃ dvinetraṃ ca nāgayajñopavītinam ।
bhīmadaṃṣṭrograrūpantu *ekavaktraṃ caturbhujam ।* (l.5)
vismitaṃ hastasaṃyuktaṃ daṇḍāyudhasamanvitam । (l.6)
savyapārśvasthitaṃ devaṃ daṇḍinañca svarūpakam ॥ (p.36a, l.1) (side heading)
(muṇḍi, daṇḍi)
punarapimuṇḍidhyānam-
atyugraṃ kṛṣṇavarṇantu caturbāhudvinetrakam ।
daṇḍāyudhasamāyuktaṃ *nāgābharaṇabhūṣitam ।* (l.2)
nāgayajñopavītañca vismitaṃ bhasmasaṃyutam ।
vāmapārśvasthitaṃ *devaṃ muṇḍināñca svarūpakam ।* (l.3)
dvibhujadaṇḍi-
raktavarṇaṃ dvinetrañca *nāgayajñopavītinam ।* (l.4)
bhīmarūpaṃ sudamṣṭrañca dvibhujaṃ ekavaktrakam । (l.5)
vismitaṃ hastasaṃyuktaṃ daṇḍāyudhasamāyutam ।
savyasthitāṃ dvārapālāṃ daṇḍinañca svarūpakam । (p.36b, l.1) (side heading)
(naṭeśam, vighneśvaram, gaṇanātham, bālagaṇapatim)
naṭeśadhyānam-
ekāsyantu caturbhujaṃ triṇayanaṃ vāme tu durdhūrakam ।
candrapatraśikhi*prasāritakaraṃ cordhvaṃ padaṃ kuñcitam ।* (l.2)
savyesvastikakuṇḍale ḍamarukaṃ *gaṅgādhare bibhratam ।* (l.3)
vande kīrṇajaṭaṃ naṭeśaṃ bhasmāradehe sthitam । (l.4)

gajānanaṃ bhūtagaṇādhisevitam ।
kapitthajambuphalasārabhakṣitam ।
umāsutaṃ śokavināśakāraṇam । (l.5)
namāmi vighneśvarapādapaṅkajam ।

kuṅkumavarṇa caturbhujayuktam ।
nāgamukhaṃ (makuṭaṃ)sakaraṇḍam । (l.6)
aṅkuśalaḍḍukadantasupāśam ।
vahnisadṛśaṃ gaṇanāthasvarūpam ।

karasthakadalīcūtapalasokṣukamodakam । (l.7)
bālasūryaprabhaṃ devaṃ vande bālagaṇādhipam । (p.37a, l.1) (side heading)
(pañcamūrtti, vighneśvaram, dakṣiṇāmūrtti, viṣṇu)
raktavarṇasamāyuktaṃ rucirāsanasaṃsthitam ।
caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca nāgayajñopavītinam । (l.2)
lamboṣṭhaṃ gajahastaṃ syāt lājā kapitthadhāriṇam ।
laḍḍukaṃ ketakīpuṣpaṃ vāmapārśve tu *hastayoḥ ।* (l.3)
amṛtaṃ dantadhāriṇyaṃ dakṣapārśve tathaiva ca ।
karaṇḍamakuṭopetaṃ *pañcatālapramāṇataḥ ।* (l.4)
gaṇeśañca samāyuktaṃ dakṣiṇena samācaret । (l.5)
bodhamantrānamudrāṃ ca agnisarvakarāmbujam ।
vaṭavṛkṣasamīpyasthaṃ muni..tasmātgurum । (l.6)
vibhūtirudrākṣaśāṃ...hyāt dakṣiṇāmūrttirīśvaram ।

viṣṇu -
pītāmbaradharaṃ devaṃ kirīṭaṃ maṇihemakam ।
śaṅkhacakrābhaṃ varaṃ śyāmavarṇatripāmayam ।
lakṣmībhūdevipatniṃ ca viṣṇuṃ garuḍavāhanam ॥ (p.37b, l.1) (side heading)
(brahmā, durgā)
kamaṇḍalyakṣamālāṃ śuklayajñopavītinam ।
samapādaṃ pītasa... (l.2) navasāvitrīṃ śaktiṃ ubhayapārśvakam ।
anantavedamadhyena kuṇḍalaṃ ca... (l.3) yuktaṃ ।
brahmāṇaṃ kamalāsanam ।

durgādhyānam-
sahasranīla... (l.4) dalākṛtim ।
sustanāṃ cāruvadanāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām । (l.5)
rāñcaturbhujaṃ ūruhasmasamāyuktaṃ mahiṣasya śirastitā...(p.38a, l.1) (side heading)
(viṣṇu, lakṣmī)
viṣṇudhyānam -
viṣṇuścaturbhujo maulī śaṅkhacakragadābjadhṛk ।
nīlāmbudapratikāśo garuḍāsanasamsthitaḥ । (l.2)
lakṣmīdhyānam-
caturbhujāṃ mahālakṣmīṃ abhayaṃ varadaṃ tathā ।
padmālanāṃ padmā... (kamalā śrīharipriyā) (l.3)
padmapuṣpaviśālākṣīṃ dhyāyedgovindavallabhām ॥ (l.4)
...yanamaḥ । vāsudevāya namaḥ । aniruddhāya namaḥ । sāmāya namaḥ । acyutāya namaḥ । sampūjya
(ūrdhvatāṇḍavam) (p.38b, l.1) (side heading)
ūrdhvatāṇḍavadhyānam -
ekavaktraṃ triṇetraṃ dīrghahastaṃ ṣaḍaṅgakam ।
abhayaṃ..ḍamaruṃ tṛṭihastarakam । (l.2)
pādāgrenyastahastañca nāgahastañcavahnikam ।
ityevāṣṭakarā..proktāḥūrdhvapādaṃ*viśeṣataḥ ।* (l.3)
sthitaṃ vai dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ udhṛtaṃ vāmapādakam ।
...brahmādicandrārka*nandikeśvarasevitam ।* (l.4)
narttanaṃ tu sabhāmadhye paramānandarūpiṇam ।
amṛtaṃ *satyamamalaṃ paraṃ guhyaparaṃ śivam ।* (l.5)
havaṃ naṭeśarūpantu dhyānamantreṇa pūjayet ।
(ūrdhvatāṇḍavadevīdhyānam) (p.39a, l.1) (side heading)
devīdhyānam ।
bhavānīṃ śyāmalābhāsaṃ dvinetrāṃ yugmapāṇikām ।
vāme kaṭakahastāñca dakṣelambakarāṃ bhaje ।
(devī, gajamukham) (p.40a, l.1) (side heading)
dvibhujāṃ ca dvinetrāñca kirīṭamakuṭānvitam ।
kiñcitkuñcitavāme ca vāmecalavakam । (l.2)
tathā savye śuddhākṛtiṃ jiṣṇuṃ kevalaṃ bhujameva ca । (l.3)
ekāsyaṃ trivilocanaṃ gajamukhaṃ raktaṃ caturhastakam ।
vāme laḍḍukavāmanyekarayo dantāṅkuśaṃ bibhṛtam ।
vāmenidritapādamanyacaraṇaṃ hyudhṛtyavinyastakam ।
hrasvantundilaśrūrpakarṇamaniśaṃ vighneśvaraṃ bhāvayet ॥
(vṛṣabham, vṛṣabhaśakti) (p.40b, l.1) (side heading)
śrutipādamanalaśriṅgaṃ bhāskaraṃ iṣṭanetram ।
vithīśinavadanarudraṃ aśvatīkarṇarūpam । (l.2)
tavamaṇikanakamālyāṃ nūpuraṃ divyaratnam ।
sphaṭikadhavalanetraṃ vṛkṣarājaṃ namāmi । (l.3)

añjanaprabhāmanalocanatrayāṃ karpūracandanadharām ।
kastūrikā candanahimajāla *kuṅkumapaṅkaśobhām ।* (l.4)
vande vṛṣabhaśkti añjanādevī । (p.41a, l.1) (side heading)
(naṭeśvaram)
triṇetraṃ caturbhujaṃ śāntaṃ jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍalam ।
karṇapatrasamāyuktaṃ dakṣiṇe nakrakuṇḍalam । (l.2)
jaṭāvāme tu dhurdhūraṃ ardhenduparicūḍitam ।
arkapuṣpasamāyuuktaṃ bakapuṣpasamanvitam । (l.3)
āragvadhaṃ sṛjaṃcaiva stambhakaṃ ūrdhvamaṇḍitam ।
dakṣiṇe jānhavīcaiva *vyālaṃ vā cūḍitaṃ tathā ।* (l.4)
karotimadhyamenyasya kundamandasmitālalam ।
ḍamaruṃ *dakṣiṇe haste vanhinā vāmahastake ।* (l.5)
