vajraśaktisamopetaṃ varadābhayahastakam ।
nānā*vastrāmbaroyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ।* (l.4)
yoginī vāmapārśve tu bhoginī savyapārśvake । (l.5)
kuṅkumaṃ raktavarṇañca devyā ākṛtirucyate । (p.54b, l.1)
utpalaṃ vaṃ
śāntākāraṃ bhujagaśayanaṃ padmanābhaṃ sureśaṃ
viśvādhāraṃ gaganasadṛśaṃ meghavarṇaṃ śubhāṅgam । (l.2)
lakṣmīkāntaṃ kamalanayanaṃ yogibhirdhyānagamyaṃ
vande viṣṇuṃ bhavabhyaharaṃ *sarvalokaikanātham ।* (l.3)
bhūḥ pādau yasya nābhivrayidasuranilaḥcandrasūryau ca netre ।
karṇā vācā śirodyau mukhamapi gahanoṃ yasyavāso yamasthitam ।
antasthaṃ yasyaviśvaṃ suranarakhagane bhogigandharvadaityai gātrām ।
ramya...*namāmi sarvalokānām* (p.55a, l.1) ।
sihmāsanegataḥ śukraḥ saṃprāptestradivaṃ punaḥ... । (l.2)
sthite devīṃ naṣṭāvābjakarāṃ tataḥ । (l.3)
namāmi sarvalokānāṃ jananīmabdhasambhavām ।
śrīyamunnidapadmākṣi viṣṇuvakṣasthale sthitām ।
padmālayāṃ । padmakarāṃ padmapatranivekṣaṇān ।
vande padmamukhīṃ devīṃ padmanābhapriyānalam ।
tvaṃ siddhistvāsudhā svāhā । (p.55b, l.1)
aputrasya pitṛvyasyabhrātṛṇāmagninā । mātāmahasaptatnikāḥ śrāddhaṃ pitṛvadācaret । (l.2)
jyeṣṭhabhrātṛpitṛvyāṇāṃ sapatnimātramevaca mātāpitro vinānyeṣāṃ sadyatarpaṇamācaret । (l.3)
putrāpautraprapautrāśca putrikā putrameva ca । (l.4) bhrātṛputrā ca bhatrabhāryā purassaram ।
(p.56a, l.1) (side heading) (mālayapiṇḍam)
asmat kamalāmṛtāye ca gatīyyeṣāṃ vidyate ।
āvāhayiṣye tān sarvān *idamasti tilodakam ।* (l.2)
ābrahmaṇeyeva pitravaṃśajāte । mātastu dāvaṃ *śubhavāmadīyaḥ ।* (l.3)
vamśadvayesmin mama dāsabhūtāḥ ।
bhṛtyāstathaivā śrutasevakāśca (l.4) mitrāṇi sakhyuḥ । paśavāśca vṛkṣāḥ ।
spṛṣṭāśca duṣṭāścakramopakāraḥ । (l.5) janmāntare emamasaṅgatāścatebhyaḥ ।
svadhāpiṇḍamahaṃ dadāmi । (p.56b, l.1)
pitṛvamśe mṛtāye ca mātṛvamśe tathaiva ca । guruśvaśūrabandhamunāṃ cānye(l.2)
bāndhavāsmṛtāḥ । emekule luptapiṇḍāḥ putradāravi varjitāḥ । (l.3)
kriyāśca jñātāḥ kule mama teṣāṃ piṇḍāḥ putradāravivarjitāḥ ।
kriyālopahatāścaiva jātyaṃ yāḥpaṃkuvasmṛtāḥvirūpā āmagarbhāśca(l.4)
jñātā jñātāḥ kule mamateṣāṃ piṇḍamayādattaṃ akṣīya... । (l.5)
aśīpatravaneghore kampipāke ca raurave teṣāṃ uddhāratya... । (l.6)
daṇḍaṃ dadāmyaham । utsavana kulakoṭīnāṃ eṣāṃ dattaṃ kulena..(p.57a, l.1)
madhupiṇḍaṃ yādattaṃ makṣīyamupatiṣṭhatu ।
ābrahmastambha*padeva ṛṣipitṛmānavāḥ ।* (l.2)
tṛpyantu pitarasarvemātramātamahādayaḥtilodakam । (l.3)
ābrahmastambhaparyantaṃ yatkiñca sacarācalam । (l.4)
mayādattena toyena tṛptimevābhigaścatu । (l.5)
prārthanā -
ekeca pretarūpeṇa varttaṃ te pitaro mamāte sapte tṛptimāyāṃti(p.57b, l.1) kuśaḥ pṛṣṭai tilodakaiḥ ।
śvitrī kuṣṭī tathā rogī kuna viśyāvadaṃhakamitraṃ *arkapiśunasteyaḥ ।* (l.2)
vikrayīvedanandakaḥ mātāpitro gurutyāgi kuṇḍāśi(l.3)vṛṣalātmijāha
teṣāṃ tṛptimāyāṃ ti kuśaḥ pṛṣṭyaitilodakam । (l.4)
pādamūle pitākuryāt pādamadhye pitāmahaḥ ।
prapitāmahāśca pādāgre pādaprakṣālanaṃ kuru ।
pādāśaucaṃ anabhyaṅgaṃ tilahina mantrakam ।
śrārddhe dakṣiṇahīnantu nīrāśāḥ pitarogatāḥ । (p.58a, l.1) (blank)
(p.58b, l.1) krameṇaiva tu kārayet । āsīnaṃ vāsthito vāpi prabhāyāṃ yutasamyutam ।
